# VWAP_RECLAIM – Execution Lifecycle & Risk Management Fix Package

## Goal
Align VWAP_RECLAIM execution behavior with SOP intent:
- Treat VWAP_RECLAIM as a multi-phase setup (reclaim → acceptance → expansion)
- Prevent premature stop-outs
- Prevent stale or repeated reclaim executions
- Preserve A+ selectivity while restoring positive expectancy

This task list focuses on **execution lifecycle**, not detection or scoring.

