# Risk Mitigation

## High-Risk Tasks

| Task | Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------|------------|
| **Task 5 (SL placement)** | SL too wide, blow up losses | Start conservative (VWAP - 30 ticks), backtest extensively |
| **Task 6 (Grace period)** | Hold losers too long | Cap at 10 bars, monitor drawdown |
| **Task 8 (Block re-entry)** | Miss valid second attempts | Log all blocked re-entries, review for false negatives |

